      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T01:42:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need UnorientedDebugAccessory.SRC at a minimum. However, for chrome OS devices, I don\u0027t think we need OrientedDebugAccessory.SRC. No real configuration is done on the TS side, either servo_v4 handles it or the user flips SuzyQable.\n\nType-C Spec v1.4 Table 4-16 outlines the optional states. Note 6 says \"UnorientedDebugAccessory.SRC is required for any Source or DRP that supports Debug Accessory Mode. OrientedDebugAccessory.SRC is only required if orientation detection is necessary in Debug Accessory Mode.\"",
      "revId": "8fb04c3e43d2a279896883277de9b4c980d318a8",
